    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920410/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1731558099\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920410/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1731558099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920410/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1731558099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>House of Horrors: Don't Become Dinner</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lost. Alone. Hunted.</strong></h2><br>A dense fog swallows the woods, chilling you to the bone. Lost and desperate, you stumble upon a looming mansion, its windows dark and menacing. Seeking refuge for the night, you step inside, unaware of the horrors that lurk within.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to your worst nightmare.</strong></h2><br><strong>House of Horrors</strong> is a heart-pounding survival horror experience that will test your will to survive. Explore the decaying halls of a derelict mansion, each creaking floorboard and flickering candle a portent of the terror to come.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unmask the Darkness:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fight for your life:</strong> Scavenge for weapons and use your environment to your advantage. Defend yourself against deranged cannibals and bloodthirsty maniacs who call this house their domain.<br></li><li><strong>Unravel a twisted past:</strong> Uncover the chilling secrets hidden within the mansion's dusty walls. Solve puzzles, decipher cryptic clues, and piece together the history of this macabre place.<br></li><li><strong>Every choice matters:</strong> Your decisions determine your fate. Choose to confront the horrors head-on, or use stealth and cunning to outmaneuver your pursuers. Can you escape with your sanity intact?</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Intense atmosphere:</strong> Immerse yourself in a world of dread with chilling sound design and haunting visuals.<br></li><li><strong>Brutal combat:</strong> Utilize improvised weapons and craft traps to fend off relentless enemies.<br></li><li><strong>Exploration and discovery:</strong> Uncover the mansion's dark secrets as you navigate its perilous depths.<br></li><li><strong>Multiple endings:</strong> Every choice you make shapes the outcome of your fight for survival.</li></ul><br><strong>House of Horrors</strong> is not for the faint of heart.  Do you have the courage to face the terrors within, or will you become another victim of this house's insatiable hunger?",
